---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy" description="Trust-Wise privacy policy.">
  <section class="wrap page prose">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>We do not collect personal data directly. Affiliate partners (such as Shopee and hotel booking sites) may set cookies when you click their links, to track referrals. Their own privacy policies apply on their sites.</p>
    <p>We use Google Tag Manager and Google Analytics to understand how visitors use the site, such as which pages are read and which links are clicked. These tools use cookies and collect anonymous usage data. You can opt out with the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Google Analytics opt-out add-on</a> or by blocking cookies in your browser.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
